                </div>
                <h1 style='color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800;'>EngageGPT 3.3</h1>
                <p style='color: #e0e7ff; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 18px;'>Flawless Commenting & Maximum Stability.</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body Content -->
            <tr>
              <td style='padding: 30px;'>

                <p style='font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6;'>Hi {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

                <p style='font-size: 16px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;'>
                  Thank you for your patience! We've pushed our latest update, and we are thrilled to announce that <strong>EngageGPT 3.3 is officially live.</strong>
                </p>

                <!-- Core Update Box -->
                <div style='background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 30px 0;'>
                  <h2 style='margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 20px; color: #1e40af; display: flex; align-items: center;'>
                    <span style='font-size: 24px; margin-right: 10px;'>🚀</span>
                    Direct Commenting is Working Flawlessly
                  </h2>
                  <p style='margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1e3a8a; line-height: 1.6;'>
                    The bugs have been squashed. You can now reliably
                    <strong>generate and post comments directly on LinkedIn</strong>
                    without ever leaving the platform. Seamless, one-click engagement is back and faster than ever.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Troubleshooting / Important Instruction Box -->
                <div style='border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; background: #fffbeb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 30px;'>
                  <h3 style='margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #b45309; display: flex; align-items: center;'>
                    <span style='margin-right: 8px;'>⚠️</span> Important Setup Instruction
                  </h3>
                  <p style='font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.6;'>
                    To ensure you are on the latest stable build without browser caching issues, if the extension is not working properly, please:
                  </p>
                  <ol style='font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 12px 0; padding-left: 20px; font-weight: 600;'>
                    <li>Remove the EngageGPT extension from your browser.</li>
                    <li>Add/Reinstall the extension again.</li>
                  </ol>
                  <p style='font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;'>
                    <em>If it still doesn't work after reinstalling, please report it immediately using the <strong>Support Chatbot</strong> on our website so our dev team can assist you directly.</em>
                  </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Perplexity Reminder Box -->
                <div style='border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;'>
