                        <strong>Perplexity AI Integration</strong>
                        <p style='margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8;'>
                          We are currently putting the final touches on the 
                          <strong>Perplexity AI Comment option.</strong>
                          Stay tuned—it will be fully operational very soon!
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
