                  </p>
                  <p style='font-size: 14px; color: #4f46e5; font-weight: 600;'>
                    <a href='mailto:bharat.pahwa@engagegpt.in' style='color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: none;'>bharat.pahwa@engagegpt.in</a><br />
                    <a href='mailto:support@engagegpt.in' style='color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: none;'>support@engagegpt.in</a>
                  </p>

                  <p style='margin-top:25px; color: #1e293b; font-size: 15px;'>
